sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant UI as HRMS Web
    participant SettingSvc as Setting Service
    participant DB as Setting DB
    participant AuthSvc as Authorization Service
    participant DirectorySvc as Directory Service

    Admin->>UI: Create Company

    UI->>SettingSvc: Create Company<br/>selectedCopyCategories

    SettingSvc->>DB: Load Tenant + Default Company

    SettingSvc->>DB: BEGIN
    SettingSvc->>DB: Create Company<br/>status = PENDING
    SettingSvc->>DB: Create Setup Progress

    opt Copy Grades
        SettingSvc->>DB: Load active Grades<br/>from Default Company
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create independent Grade copies
    end

    opt Copy Job Titles
        SettingSvc->>DB: Load active Job Titles<br/>from Default Company
        SettingSvc->>DB: Create independent Job Title copies
    end

    SettingSvc->>DB: COMMIT

    opt Copy Roles
        SettingSvc->>AuthSvc: Request role configuration initialization
    end

    opt Copy Organization Responsibilities
        SettingSvc->>DB: Copy responsibility configuration
    end

    SettingSvc-->>UI: Company created<br/>status = PENDING
    UI-->>Admin: Show setup progress